  "question": {
    "text": "An electric field $\\vec{E}=(2 x \\hat{i}) N C^{-1}$ exists in space. A cube of side $2 \\mathrm{~m}$ is placed in the space as per figure given below. The electric flux through the cube is ______ $\\mathrm{Nm}^2 / \\mathrm{C}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/MoOHrmeRYWxegr2qawK9H96Mwj1qwshO3uKtLl6wGc8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/owamCC5D1zTjcvtp4-0R6OqOhlfdPFA2rb9kPdFkofc.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{E}}=2 x \\hat{\\mathrm{i}} \\\\ &amp; \\phi=\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{E}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{A}}\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\phi_{\\text {in }}=-4 \\times 4=-16 \\mathrm{Nm}^2 / \\mathrm{c} \\\\ &amp; \\phi_{\\text {out }}=8 \\times 4=32 \\mathrm{Nm}^2 / \\mathrm{c} \\\\ &amp; d_{\\text {net }}=\\phi_{\\text {in }+} \\phi_{\\text {out }}=-16+32=16 \\mathrm{Nm}^2 / \\mathrm{c}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
